<!--
  XPath & LDAP Injection Lab - the XML user directory.

  Levels 1-5 evaluate real XPath 1.0 expressions against this document with
  DOMDocument + DOMXPath. Nothing here is simulated: if an injected expression
  selects a node, the level shows that node.

  Note the shape. A <user> holds five fields that the application knows about
  and, for two accounts, an extra field the application never renders. Those
  extra fields are what the injection levels are reaching for:

    mfrost/pin              - level 4
    svc_backup/recovery_token - level 2
    svc_backup/apikey         - level 3
    vault/secret[@name=master] - level 5
-->
